 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 13.7,
   "end": 17.5,
   "text": "Someday you'll come back here"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.65,
   "end": 23.0,
   "text": "And you'll open up your arms"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.85,
   "end": 31.35,
   "text": "And you'll laugh and say I knew it wouldn't take you long"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.05,
   "end": 34.9,
   "text": "To realize I was gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.05,
   "end": 41.35,
   "text": "And it's only been three years"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.3,
   "end": 47.4,
   "text": "But to me it's been so long"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.45,
   "end": 55.65,
   "text": "And I remember it like yesterday oh you could say"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.3,
   "end": 58.7,
   "text": "I've been holding on"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.4,
   "end": 64.9,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.9,
   "end": 71.15,
   "text": "For you to make it right, but the time has come and gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.7,
   "end": 77.3,
   "text": "And it's faded and lost all its light"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.3,
   "end": 83.4,
   "text": "A star that shines so bright falls from the sky"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.3,
   "end": 88.25,
   "text": "Don't make a wish that won't come true"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.95,
   "end": 94.9,
   "text": "And I learned that from you such a long time ago"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.7,
   "end": 100.25,
   "text": "When you left you said you had to find"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.9,
   "end": 106.75,
   "text": "A better way of life this one just wouldn't do"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.35,
   "end": 113.0,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.0,
   "end": 119.2,
   "text": "For you to take your time to find your place"
  },
  {
   "start": 120.75,
   "end": 123.75,
   "text": "But I learned that this world still turns without you"
  },
  {
   "start": 123.75,
   "end": 128.45,
   "text": "And you were just a phase and I learned without you here"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.45,
   "end": 133.55,
   "text": "I was happier alone than I ever would have known"
  },
  {
   "start": 157.0,
   "end": 160.2,
   "text": "And I waited and I waited"
  },
  {
   "start": 163.2,
   "end": 168.7,
   "text": "And I waited and I waited and I waited"
  },
  {
   "start": 168.7,
   "end": 173.4,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 173.4,
   "end": 179.55,
   "text": "For you to take your time, but the time has come and gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 181.1,
   "end": 185.75,
   "text": "And it's faded and lost all its light"
  },
  {
   "start": 185.75,
   "end": 191.15,
   "text": "A star that shines so bright falls from the sky"
  },
  {
   "start": 191.15,
   "end": 195.05,
   "text": "On this cold December night"
  }
 ],
